 "notes": [
  "Facing north (-Z). Origin at feet centre. 1 grid square = 1 texture pixel = 1/16 block. Hitbox 2.5 x 3 x 2 blocks; the long arms and fists reach past its sides.",
  "Bones (16): root > body > chest, cage, splinter, back; body > head > jaw, brow; body > arm_l > forearm_l > fist_l (same on the right); body > leg_l, leg_r.",
  "Animations: spawn (unfolds from a rock pile), idle (jaw grinds), walk (knuckle-walk: fists plant, body swings), run, attack (overhead double-fist smash), hurt, death (crumbles; the splinter drops out of the cage), ability_leap_slam (crouch, jump, land fists-first), ability_call_adds (beats chest, Mites crawl out of cracks).",
  "Each ore tooth uses a different ore colour (iron, gold, redstone, diamond); the splinter is caged behind copper bars in an open chest cavity."
 ],
